 "text": "Hello, how are you holding up? Totally normal. I was the same. Best way to get over it is little bits at time. Spend few days in a city with good bike lanes and see how you feel. Start on the quieter sides of streets, towards the green areas, and you' notice it changes fast. Also, try game yourself for time. A sane goal, like being first in your flat in an hour, can make huge difference. Great. And always stop and take a breath every ten minutes or so, traffic seems to fly by.",
